{"identity_key": "x:2116908128121852002", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2116908128121852002", "title": null, "content": "11月2日は『虹の彼方に』「野々村孝美」ちゃんの誕生日です！\n\nお誕生日おめでとうございます\n風紀委員として常に頑張ってる子だけど、頑張り続けるのは疲れるからたまの息抜きを一緒にどうぞ\n#11月2日\n\n#エフアンドシー\n\n#誕生日", "publisher": "FANDC_Staff", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/FANDC_Staff/status/2116908128121852002", "published_at": "2026-11-01T15:00:00+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Nov 1, 2026 · 3:00 PM UTC", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T15:18:34.908452+00:00", "media": [{"url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTmCCLqa4AAU93L.png?name=orig", "type": "image"}], "metadata": {"account": "FANDC_Staff", "author_name": "エフアンドシー(feat. デュプリン)", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": 8, "views": 300}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "html"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2116908121884901614", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2116908121884901614", "title": null, "content": "本日11/2は 家族計画 (D.O.) 発売25周年記念日です🎉\n\n\n\n山田一(田中ロミオ)3部作最終作\n\n\n\n氏の名前を一躍有名にした神作\n\n密入国者,家出娘,リストラ中年等社会的弱者で形成される擬似家族で繰り広げられるハートフルホームコメディ\n\n家族をテーマとした楽しくも心に突き刺してくる歴史に名を遺した神作です", "publisher": "youtan0309", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/youtan0309/status/2116908121884901614", "published_at": "2026-11-01T15:00:01+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Sun, 01 Nov 2026 15:00:01 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T15:20:07.456731+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "youtan0309", "author_name": "youtan0309", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
